{"title":"2026 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number one million is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/7/23715bdb1a4d8cf95111736218fa062d4e7c3679.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   10^{3} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   10^{4} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   10^{5} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   10^{6} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   10^{7} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"467\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since one million is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d0719671cbf653c7ab0101af730760c79f5ec972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,000,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> it has 6 zeros in it. Therefore making it <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/a/b1acd9e210021e8c5e3250b974b1a12b65c4de11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} 10^{6} }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" /> since each factor of ten adds on one zero.\n</p><p>~any1sgame\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 16/1000000\nPost‐